Package: parlcat2Rep
Title: Access the Speech Corpus of the Parliament of Catalonia (1932-1938)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Toni", "Rodon", role = "aut"),
    person("David", "Carbonell", email = "maintainer@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = "TODO: replace placeholder e-mail before release")
    )
Description: Programmatic access to 'Voices of the Republic', the corpus of
    plenary speeches of the Parliament of Catalonia during the Spanish Second
    Republic (1932-1938). Includes speaker, party and office metadata, the
    reference tables used to build them, government/opposition helpers,
    text search, keyword-in-context and trend utilities, and conversion to
    'quanteda' and 'tidytext' objects.
